Admin Sync Controls & Post-Test Integration
I have successfully updated the dashboard with the new Post-test Google Sheet and implemented Admin controls!

What Changed?
Integrated Post-test Sheet

The dashboard now natively links to the Post-test sheet you provided (1K9ent4CeXrKpA4-EqiPQ-OiEJVwx0mtPgZYfaajjChc).
Automated Live View for Users

Regular users no longer see the "⚙️ Sync / Paste Data" button.
When any user opens the dashboard, it automatically and silently pulls the most up-to-date information directly from the Pre-test and Post-test Google Sheets. They just see the updated dashboard!
Admin Controls

I added a hidden Admin mode to control syncing and pasting configurations.
To access the Admin controls, simply add ?admin=1 to the end of your browser URL.
Example: If you open the file in your browser, the URL might look like file:///C:/Users/asus/.../PrePostDashboard.html. Just change it to file:///C:/Users/asus/.../PrePostDashboard.html?admin=1 and press Enter.
The "Sync / Paste Data" buttons will magically reappear, allowing you to manually paste data or change the connected Google Sheets if ever needed!